SWAT+ Model Sources (@SWAT_VERSION@)

Documentation comments use `!<` (documents the preceding entity) and `!>`
(documents the following entity). The legacy `!` and `!!` comments that appear
throughout the sources are deliberately *not* documentation markers, so files
can be converted to FORD comments one at a time without the unconverted files
producing garbage output. See `doc/ford_comment_playbook.md`.
